# This file keeps the data directory structure in git
# The actual data files are ignored by .gitignore
# 
# Directory structure:
# data/
# ├── uploads/     - User uploaded Excel/CSV files (ignored)
# ├── exports/     - Generated reports and exports (ignored)  
# ├── backups/     - Database backups (ignored)
# └── .gitkeep     - This file (tracked) 